-- MT2009_PLUS_KAWUCO_V1 (the owner, 15 October 2026): Kawuco (20413) on Przyladek Smoczego Ognia (301, 662,1224 as on
-- the pl-wiki's "Kawuco": "NPC do ulepszania zbroi i butow"). His cube window makes Ogniste Buty from Buty Zimorodka
-- +5..+9 and Buty Oceanu from Buty Euforii +5..+9 (cube.buty.txt, 5/10/30/40/50% by plus) - the wiki's "Produkcja butow". Its other gallery,
-- "Produkcja zbroi" (Owsap's cube.txt: the armours 20760-20950 from 20005-21099 +5..+9), is not in this world - the
-- armours 20760-20950 and most of their materials (30601, 30605, 30607, 30609, 30614, 30615) do not exist here: not
-- added (the owner: no new item families). Cube_open refuses an NPC that has no recipe in cube.txt. The text without
-- diacritics, as Seon-Pyeong's.
quest kawuco begin
	state start begin
		when 20413.chat."Wytwarzanie Butow" begin
			say_title(mob_name(20413)..":")
			say("Witaj, wedrowcze! Z dobrych butow potrafie uszyc")
			say("jeszcze lepsze. Przynies mi:")
			say("")
			say("- Buty Zimorodka +5..+9 - zrobie z nich Ogniste Buty,")
			say("- Buty Euforii +5..+9 - zrobie z nich Buty Oceanu.")
			say("")
			say("Do tego Wzor Kroju, Niebieski Barwnik (Ogniste Buty)")
			say("albo Czerwony Barwnik (Buty Oceanu), 5 Ciezkich Pasow")
			say("i 400 000 Yang. Szansa zale¿y od plusa butów:")
			say("+5: 5%, +6: 10%, +7: 30%, +8: 40%, +9: 50%.")
			say("Bonusy i kamienie oddanych butow przepadaja.")
			say("")
			local s = select("Otworz okno ulepszania", "Anuluj")
			if s == 1 then
				setskin(NOWINDOW)
				command("cube open")
			end
		end
	end
end
